<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech central bank one-week rev repo yields 31 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech central bank one-week rev repo yields 31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech Natianal Bank (CNB) one-week reverse repo tender draining liquidity from the interbank market reached the maximum offered yield of 31 percent, the CNB said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The CNB said it accepted all bids at the maximum level. It did not provide any further details on the tender.</p>
</text>
